[32m+[m[32m# RBU CampusOS Project Context[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mRBU CampusOS is a student-focused digital campus operating system for Ramdeobaba University. It is not primarily an ERP or generic SaaS dashboard.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mProject documentation lives under `docs/`.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## Project context[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mUse documentation contextually:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m- `docs/STATE.md` — current project state, active work, known issues, and next task[m
[32m+[m[32m- `docs/PRODUCT.md` — product definition, features, terminology, and product principles[m
[32m+[m[32m- `docs/DESIGN.md` — UI/UX, typography, motion, spatial/3D design, responsive behavior, and visual principles[m
[32m+[m[32m- `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md` — backend, Supabase, APIs, infrastructure, security, and production architecture[m
[32m+[m[32m- `docs/DECISIONS.md` — durable project decisions that should not repeatedly be reopened[m
[32m+[m[32m- `docs/tasks/` — scoped implementation tasks and acceptance criteria[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mFor normal work, inspect the actual code and read only the documentation relevant to the active task.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mDo not load every project document unnecessarily.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## Source of truth[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mUse information in this order:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m1. current repository/code[m
[32m+[m[32m2. `docs/STATE.md`[m
[32m+[m[32m3. active task file[m
[32m+[m[32m4. relevant durable documentation[m
[32m+[m[32m5. conversation history[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mCurrent code is authoritative for implementation reality.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mDo not rely on previous conversation memory when the repository provides newer information.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## Task discipline[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mWork on one defined task or goal at a time.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mDo not opportunistically redesign or refactor unrelated areas.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mPreserve working authentication, Supabase integrations, application routes, data behavior, and other existing functionality unless the active task explicitly changes them.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mDemo data may remain where real production data is not yet available.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mDo not fabricate functionality or represent demo information as verified real information.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## Design work[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mFor frontend work, follow `docs/DESIGN.md`.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mCampusOS should feel authored, spatial, interactive, premium, and coherent.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m"3D" means spatial interface design and interaction.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mDo not treat arbitrary blobs, spheres, floating objects, or decorative WebGL scenes as sufficient 3D design.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mAvoid generic AI-generated dashboard patterns and component-library-demo aesthetics.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## Dependencies and tools[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mInspect `package.json` before assuming a dependency exists.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mPrefer existing tooling over adding redundant packages.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mDo not use multiple libraries to solve the same problem without a clear reason.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mUse connected tools, MCPs, skills, browser automation, and design resources only when they materially improve the active task.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## Verification[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mBefore declaring a task complete:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m- inspect the actual result[m
[32m+[m[32m- run relevant checks[m
[32m+[m[32m- verify acceptance criteria[m
[32m+[m[32m- inspect for runtime/console errors when applicable[m
[32m+[m[32m- verify important responsive behavior when applicable[m
[32m+[m[32m- inspect `git diff`[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mWriting code is not sufficient evidence that the task is complete.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## State handoff[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mAfter a meaningful milestone, or before stopping unfinished work, update `docs/STATE.md`.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mRecord only:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m- current objective[m
[32m+[m[32m- what was completed[m
[32m+[m[32m- what remains[m
[32m+[m[32m- known bugs/regressions[m
[32m+[m[32m- important changed areas when useful[m
[32m+[m[32m- exact next task[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mDo not turn `STATE.md` into a reasoning transcript or development diary.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## Interrupted-task recovery[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mWhen continuing after a usage limit, context reset, new conversation, or model switch:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m1. read `docs/STATE.md`[m
[32m+[m[32m2. read the active task[m
[32m+[m[32m3. inspect `git status`[m
[32m+[m[32m4. inspect `git diff`[m
[32m+[m[32m5. inspect the relevant implementation[m
[32m+[m[32m6. continue from the first incomplete acceptance criterion[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mDo not restart completed work solely because previous chat context is unavailable.[m
